stages.sampleAnswer:
GET /profiles?lat=40.7&lng=-74.0&radius=5&minAge=25&maxAge=35
  → { profiles: [{ id, name, age, photos, bio, distance }] }

POST /swipes
  body: { targetUserId, direction: "left" | "right" }
  → { matched: true }  [if both swiped right]

GET /matches
  → { matches: [{ userId, name, lastMessage, timestamp }] }

WS /messages/:matchId
  client sends: { text }
  server sends: { senderId, text, timestamp }
